@startuml CryptoWeb-state-06-ledger-block
title CryptoWeb - Settlement and Security Audit Block Lifecycle

!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 65
skinparam ranksep 65
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam StateFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
hide empty description

state "SEALED" as Sealed
state "FINALIZED" as Finalized

[*] --> Sealed : successful commit creates block and items
Sealed --> Finalized : administrator finalizes [integrity checks pass]

note right of Sealed
  Blocks are stored in separate
  settlement and security-audit
  collections. Each new block has
  a computed hash and linked items.
end note

note right of Finalized
  Finalization checks the Merkle root,
  commit key and block hash before
  updating the block. Failed checks
  leave the block SEALED.
end note

@enduml
